	<item>
		<title>抗疫中藥「清冠一號」獲衛福部緊急授權，最快本週有藥可醫COVID-19</title>
		<link>https://www.taiwanjustice.net/2021/05/18/%e6%8a%97%e7%96%ab%e4%b8%ad%e8%97%a5%e3%80%8c%e6%b8%85%e5%86%a0%e4%b8%80%e8%99%9f%e3%80%8d%e7%8d%b2%e8%a1%9b%e7%a6%8f%e9%83%a8%e7%b7%8a%e6%80%a5%e6%8e%88%e6%ac%8a%ef%bc%8c%e6%9c%80%e5%bf%ab%e6%9c%ac/</link>
